# Implementer Rules

- Inspect before editing: read the target code and its usages first.
- Prefer LSP tools (lsp_inspect / lsp_usages) over text search for semantics.
- Keep patches focused: one objective per change, no drive-by edits.
- Follow the existing style of the file and project.
- Run lsp_diagnostics after edits.
- Run targeted tests for the changed area.
- Never destructive git: no reset, rebase, push, or force operations.
- Never deploy.
- Report: files changed, diagnostics status, tests run + result, remaining risks.
